---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "About Us"
description: "Palm River Academy is a licensed English language center in Hội An, open since 2017. Our vision, our staff and our story."
---
{% import "macros/icons.njk" as ic %}

{% set heroPhoto = "students-waterfall-field-trip" %}
{% set heroEyebrow = "About Us" %}
{% set heroTitle = "Our vision. Our staff. Our story." %}
{% set heroText = site.licenceLine + " We teach English through content, in small classes, to children from 20 months to 18 years." %}
{% include "partials/pagehero.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap two">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--blue">Our story</p>
      <h2>Hội An's oldest international learning center</h2>
      <p>We opened in {{ site.founded }} with a handful of families who wanted their children to learn English without sitting still all day. That is still the idea. We follow the Cambridge curriculum for English, Maths and Science because it is clear and recognised anywhere, and we wrap it in things you can touch: cooking, art, technology, sport, and projects the students choose.</p>
      <p>We welcome students from 20 months to 18 years, Vietnamese and international families side by side. Academic classes never go above {{ site.classCap }} children. We prepare students for more than one path: universities abroad, or meaningful work at home.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="blob-wrap has-sticker">
      <span class="sticker sticker--tr">Since {{ site.founded }}</span>
      {% photo "primary-students-clay-modelling", "photo--lg photo--tilt-r" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "pale" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--pale">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our philosophy</p>
      <h2>Students learn best when engaged</h2>
      <p class="lede">We are an English language center, and we believe the fastest way to learn a language is to use it for something real. So we teach content through context: science, maths, cooking, art and sport, all in English, all hands-on.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="method">
      <div class="method__item">{{ ic.icon("sparkle", "sun") }}<strong>Play-based and project-based</strong><p>Exploration and problem-solving over outcomes alone. In Early Years that means play. Later it means experiments, building, presenting and a personal project.</p></div>
      <div class="method__item">{{ ic.icon("chat", "blue") }}<strong>English as the medium</strong><p>The language is never the lesson on its own. It is how you measure, explain, argue and present. Children pick it up because they need it.</p></div>
      <div class="method__item">{{ ic.icon("star", "coral") }}<strong>Confidence and independence</strong><p>Adaptable learners who think critically and creatively, ready to contribute at home and as global citizens.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% set waveColor = "white" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--coral">Our PRA values</p>
      <h2>Six principles</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="values values--3">
      <li><div><strong>Intellectual Exploration</strong><p>Curiosity and deep thinking through hands-on experiences that make students ask questions and find answers.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Creative Expression</strong><p>Students develop their own voice through arts, projects and inventive problem-solving.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Sports and Fun</strong><p>Play and physical activity are essential for healthy development and strong relationships.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Community Impact</strong><p>Students take part in the life of Hội An and give something back to it.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Global Citizenship</strong><p>Understanding and respecting other cultures, starting with the one at the next desk.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Leadership Development</strong><p>Confidence and the skills to guide others and take initiative, in school and beyond.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "pale" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--pale">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--blue">Our academy team</p>
      <h2>Vietnamese and international teachers</h2>
      <p class="lede">{{ team.intro }}</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="team mt">
      {% for m in team.members %}
      <li>
        {% if photos["team-" + m.slug] %}{% photo "team-" + m.slug, "", "116px" %}{% else %}<div class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">{{ m.name | replace("Mr. ", "") | replace("Ms. ", "") | first }}</div>{% endif %}
        <strong>{{ m.name }}</strong>
        <em>{{ m.role }}</em>
        {% if m.teaches %}<small>{{ m.teaches }}</small>{% endif %}
        {% if m.bio %}<p>{{ m.bio }}</p>{% endif %}
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
{% set waveColor = "white" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap two">
    <div class="blob-wrap blob-wrap--green">
      {% photo site.campus.photo, "photo--lg photo--wide" %}
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Our campus</p>
      <h2>One site in Cẩm Thanh</h2>
      <p>All our students, from Nursery to Upper Years, learn on one campus a few minutes from Hội An's old town: classrooms, a library, a kitchen, a maker space, a turf field, a sand playground and a treehouse.</p>
      <p><strong>{{ site.campus.address }}</strong></p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.campus.mapUrl }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Open in Google Maps</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "blue" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
